OL,3,GNEWSATotal cost to revamp Fort Regent
OL,4,Aexpected to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of redeveloping Fort Regent is
OL,7,Fexpected to rise due to inflation and
OL,8,Fdesign changes, Jersey officials have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAnswering a written question,
OL,12,FInfrastructure Minister Jonathan Renouf
OL,13,Fsaid the #110m costing of the project
OL,14,Ffrom two years ago had been impacted by
OL,15,Finflationary pressures, design changes,
OL,16,Fand the Middle East conflict.
OL,18,FThe government's revamp of the St
OL,19,FHelier site is expected to include a
OL,20,F2,500-seat theatre, a 12-lane bowling
OL,21,Falley, a six-screen cinema, and places
OL,22,Fto eat and drink.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
