OL,3,GNEWSATotal cost to revamp Fort Regent
OL,4,Aexpected to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut approval of changes to the first
OL,7,Fphase, which includes making the
OL,8,Fbuilding safe by removing asbestos and
OL,9,Ffixing the roof, was delayed due to the
OL,10,Felection period. The new total cost is
OL,11,Funclear.
